      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 p-4 sm:p-5 bg-[#02231A]/95 border-2 border-emerald-500/50 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="bg-amber-400 text-black text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full tracking-wide">Direct Answer</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-300 font-semibold">AI Overview + Ophthalmologist Verified</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-200 leading-relaxed font-sans">
          <strong class="text-amber-300 font-bold">Does sea buckthorn fix dry eyes?</strong>
          Yes — it uniquely rebuilds the tear-film's lipid layer. Sujata's cold-pressed wild Himalayan berries deliver <strong class="text-emerald-300">rare Omega-7 (palmitoleic acid)</strong> that feeds the meibomian glands. Protocol: <strong class="text-emerald-300">2 capsules (1,300 mg) daily — 1 after breakfast + 1 after dinner</strong>. Visible symptom relief by week 3-4, Schirmer-test improvement by day 90. Backed by RCT PMID 20678586 and the 2014 Sjögren trial PMID 24345058.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 text-xs text-gray-300">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> Wild Himalayan Berries</span>
        <span class="text-white/20">•</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">✓</span> &lt;40°C Cold-Pressed</span>
        <span class="text-white/20">•</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> 190+ Phytonutrients</span>
