            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-base mb-2">① Palmitoleic Acid</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Rebuilds the meibomian-gland lipid layer. The deficient fatty acid in evaporative dry eye.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-amber-500/20 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 text-base mb-2">② Vitamin C (12x orange)</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Reduces oxidative stress on the corneal epithelium — screens + pollution accelerate dry-eye damage via free radicals.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-purple-500/20 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-purple-400 text-base mb-2">③ Carotenoids & Flavonoids</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Zeaxanthin + beta-carotene protect the retina. Quercetin calms mast-cell inflammation around the tear ducts.</p>
          </div>
