            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Software engineers, designers, students. Blinking rate drops 50% during screen work — Omega-7 compensates for the lipid loss.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-amber-500/20 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-400 text-base mb-2">👓 Contact lens wearers</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">Lenses disrupt the tear-film oil layer. Users on the Sujata protocol report 3-4 extra hours of comfortable wear-time.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-purple-500/20 rounded-xl p-4">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-purple-400 text-base mb-2">🏥 Post-LASIK recovery</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm">6-12 month dry phase after LASIK. Omega-7 accelerates corneal-nerve regeneration. Add to your ophthalmologist's plan.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl p-4">
