            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">PMID 24345058 — Omega-7 reduced tear hyperosmolarity.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15309440/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-black/40 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-amber-400/40 transition-colors">
